              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "yvonne mp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love, love this salad. I made this as written, did not change a thing. I'm not known as a cook at all. I took this dish to a BBQ last summer and every one raved about it. I am now going to make it again for another outing, oh I too didn't add the sauce until ready to serve it .",
